{"id":"word:hebrew:H7979","type":"word","title":"שֻׁלְחָן","subtitle":"H7979 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a table (as spread out); by implication, a meal","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שֻׁלְחָן (H7979) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 71 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שֻׁלְחָן (shulchân) means a table (as spread out); by implication, a meal First listed occurrence: 1Chr 28 16."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שֻׁלְחָן","transliteration":"shulchân","pronunciation":"shool-khawn'","strong":"H7979","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7979","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["שֻׁלְחַ֥ן","הַ/שֻּׁלְחָן֙","הַ/שֻּׁלְחָֽן","הַ/שֻּׁלְחָ֔ן","לְ/שֻׁלְחֲנ֥וֹת"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncmsa",23],["HNcmpa",10],["HNcmsc",8],["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",7],["HNcmsa",5],["HC/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",3],["HR/Ncmpc",2],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",2],["HTd/Ncmpa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"a table (as spread out); by implication, a meal","usage":"table.","full":"H7979. shulchan שֻׁלְחָן 71 noun masculine Exod 25:23 table (on form of word compare GFM l.c .; properly (see above) skin or leather mat spread on ground, see also, on early Semitic 'table,' Thes 1417 We Skizzen iv. 157 RS Semitic i. 184; 2nd ed. 201 Kennedy Ency. Bib iii. 2991 ); — absolute ׳שׁ 1Sam 20:34 +; construct שֻׁלְחַן 1Kin 5:7 +; suffix שֻׁלְחָנִי Judg 1:7 +, etc.; plural שֻׁלְחָנוֺת Isa 28:8 +, construct שֻׁלְחֲנוֺת 1Chr 28:16 (twice in verse); &#8212; 1 table for king's repast Judg 1:7 (with תַּחַת ), 1Sam 20:29 , 34 ; 2Sam 9:11 (read ᵐ5 ׳שׁ דָּוִד Th We Dr and modern), 9:13 ; 19:29 ; 1Kin 2:7 ; 5:1 ; 18:19 ; 10:5 2Chr 9:4 , compare Isa 21:5 (with עָרַךְ (q. v. 1c ) arrange ); with עַל 2Sam 9:7 , 10 , 11 ; Dan 11:27 ; for governor Neh 5:17 (with עַל ). 2 for private use 1Kin 13:20 (with אֶל ), Job 36:16 ; Psa 23:5 (figurative, with עָרַךְ ), compare 78:19 ( id. ), 128:3 , also (in bedroom) 2Kin 4:10 ; of revellers Isa 28:8 , compare Psa 69:23 (figurative), of wisdom (figurative) Prov 9:2 . 3 especially Ezekiel, P for sacred uses: in tabernacle Exod 25:23 17 t. 25-40, Num 3:31 , הַמָּנִים שֻׁלְחַן 4:7 (compare 2Chr 29:18 below); ׳הַשּׁ הַטָּהֹר Leviticus 24:26 (compare 13:11 below); in Solomon's temple 1Kin 7:48 ; 2Chr 29:18 , also (10 in number) 4:8 , 19 ; 13:11 , compare 1Chr 28:16 (4 t. in verse), also Ezek 23:41 (with עָרַךְ ); in Ezekiel's temple 40:39 (twice in verse) + 6 t. Ezekiel 40 (8 in number), 40:42 (of stone, 4 in number); like altar 41:22 , = altar of burnt-offering 44:16 ; in second temple, י ׳שֻׁלְחַן Mal 1:7 , ׳שׁ אֲדֹנָֻ 1:12 ; for idolatrous meal Isa 65:11 ; figurative of ׳י 's sacrificial feast Ezek 39:20 (eschatological).","rootNote":"from 7971 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 28 16","keyReferences":["1Chr 28 16","1Chr 28 16","1Chr 28 16","1Chr 28 16","1Kgs 2 7","1Kgs 5 7","1Kgs 7 48","1Kgs 10 5"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":71,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 28 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/שֻׁלְחֲנ֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/שֻׁלְחַ֣ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֻׁלְחָ֑ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/שֻׁלְחֲנ֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 2 7","book":"1Kgs","chapter":2,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֻׁלְחָנֶ֑/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 7","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֻׁלְחַ֥ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"